# CDK deploy-time settings for the aws/ app.
#
# The VOICEVOX API key and the Slack webhook URL are NOT here any more (#182).
# They live in Secrets Manager and are read by the Lambda functions at runtime:
#
#   /englishlearn/{env}/voicevox/api-key
#   /englishlearn/{env}/voicevox/slack-webhook-url
#
# Create them once per environment — see docs/02.voicevox_api_authentication.md.
# Nothing secret belongs in this file.

# Optional: region to deploy into (defaults to ap-northeast-1).
# The secrets above must exist in the same region.
# CDK_DEFAULT_REGION=ap-northeast-1
